# Local Validation Artifacts

Store generated validation outputs, including unpacked desktop builds, release archives, and temporary build diagnostics, under the repository-root `artifacts/local-validation/` directory.

Do not create validation output directories inside product projects such as `CherryPlayList/`. The repository `.gitignore` excludes `artifacts/local-validation/`.

Keep concise validation results, commands, and outstanding manual checks in the relevant task or project documentation. Do not copy generated binaries or archives into those records.
